      "mergeID": "63003e08f7a13a449c315986",
      "mergedPostDetails": "It is very difficult to touch the  push-buttons on the photo camera with HMD, by two-handed controller.  I feel it better, that the other hand can touch one of the push-buttons, only while a hand grabs the camera. In current spec., I had grabbed the camera at a high frequency, when I try to touch the push-buttons. Or, I would like to have short-cut keys for the push-button opeartins. Thank you.",
